  - nodeID: Yes
    dialogueLines:
    - 'Great! Now, before we can truly get this guild up and running, '
    - we need a Guild Ledger to keep all our transactions and balance sheets.
    - You can buy one from the local library run by Mai.
    - It does cost 50 gold though.
    - Oh! Maybe you can go to the barracks and see if someone has a task for you
      to earn some gold!
    dialogueOptions: []
